===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|wimmen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wīfmenn||women}}, from {{m|ang|wīf||female}} + {{m|ang|menn||men, persons, human beings}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|wife|men|nocat=1}}. Spelling (with ''o'') influenced by the singular; see {{m|en|woman}} for more.

